{{!
    @template local_catquiz/modals/modal_questionpreview

    Issue #20: this used to embed the full, formatted question text - images and
    all - into a hidden modal in every single table row. The row now carries only
    the label and the question id; the text is fetched through
    local_catquiz_get_question_preview when the preview is actually opened.

    Classes required for JS:
    * catquiz-question-preview

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-action="catquiz-question-preview"
    * data-questionid

    Example context (json):
    {
        "label": "Question name",
        "id": 42
    }
}}
<a href="#" class="catquiz-question-preview" data-action="catquiz-question-preview"
   data-questionid="{{id}}" role="button">{{label}}</a>
